'' RUN: an array slice past its source's ubound stops with runtime error 6 and exit 6 in a build
'' without -exx (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003 §4); the bounds are the array's own indices, hi
'' against lbound - 1 .. ubound. Nothing is printed first: the abort goes to stderr unbuffered.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/array-slice-range.tiko -o tests/codegen/arrayslicerange.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/arrayslicerange.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/arrayslicerange.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: runtime error 6 (out of bounds array access) at line 5 of
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 'A' accessed with invalid index = 9, must be between 0 and 8
